---
description: Tie-breakers
alwaysApply: true
---

1. Invoice or credit note anywhere in the OCR → INVOICE or CREDIT_NOTE. Attachments do not override this.
2. Prefer CREDIT_NOTE over INVOICE when the document's purpose is a credit, not a charge.
3. Prefer INVOICE over STATEMENT when there is one billed job/shipment with a total due.
4. Prefer STATEMENT when the page is a list of many invoices / aging / account balance with no single invoice body.
5. Prefer BOL / PACKING_LIST / TERMS only when those are the only document types present.
6. If truly empty → BLANK.
7. Do not invent an invoice from a BOL, packing list, statement, or terms page.
